      <PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>Imperial Beach Lions Club is a nonprofit public benefit corporation organized to create and foster a spirit of understanding amoung the people of the world, promote good governement and citizenship and to take an active interest in the civic, cultural, social and moral welfare of the community.</PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>
      <ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
        <DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>The Imperial Beach Lions Club is commiteed to helping support eye health in our community by offering free vision screening and eyeglasses for those in need. Lions take this seriously and focus the service on children because their eye health can greatly impact their ability to succeed in school and in their future.Unfortunately, during the 2022 - 2023 fiscal year, because of the Covid 19 pandemic, no services were provided to the community. Many efforts were made to offer vision screenings to students but no schools asked for this service. This service was once again provided to the community in the following fiscal year.</DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>
      </ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
      <ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
        <DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>The Imperial Beach Lions Club also provides an annual scholarship program to high school seniors with the purpose of encouraging student participation in community service, recognize those who have succeeded depite unusual life challenges and reward intellectual excellence. Total scholarships paid out was $20,000.</DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>
